<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian AIICO Insurance Q1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Nigerian AIICO Insurance Q1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter results for Nigeria's AIICO Insurance Plc to end-March 1997 published on Thursday.</p>
<p>				 (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1997     1996</p>
<p> Gross premium		622	366</p>
<p> Investment income	   53	 27</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    19	 12</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	15	 10</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
